                                                "sense_id": "6f164e35-ec43-3bb0-999d-3be6354a1263",
                                                "text": "These men , from no worse motive that could be discovered than a thirst after knowledge beyond their sphere , committed burglary upon the barn in which the puppets had been consigned to repose"
